WEBVTT

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.340
It's not a good idea for the police to kill the devil that the civilians are dealing with.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.500
If it's normal, you'll be arrested.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.370
Power-chan, think about it a little more.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.920
You have to act, Denji-kun. You have to control her.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.260
Huh? Me too?

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:39.550
Before Power-chan became a demon, she was a blood demon.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:45.660
She's good at fighting with blood, but she gets excited right away.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.050
I wonder if she's not good at Devil Hunters.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:58.210
Ouch! How could you say such a lie?

00:00:58.910 --> 00:00:59.790
Liar!

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.560
I told you to kill me, didn't I?

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.160
That's scary!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Huh?

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.460
Makima-san, this devil is a liar.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.180
You're under arrest!

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.540
You're under arrest for lying!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:14.520
No!

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.180
He told me to do it!

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.110
Devils don't lie!

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.410
Only humans lie!

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.910
I didn't let you do it!

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.480
You're the proof!

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:24.440
Idiot!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.340
You're such a liar!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.700
Humans tell dirty lies!

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.530
I was told to do it!

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.660
Don't try to make a character out of me or something like that!

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:33.960
It's disgusting!

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.660
Can you do it quietly?

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.760
I-I can do it!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:45.250
You're great, Power-chan.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.320
Honestly, I don't care which one of you pulled the trigger.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.520
I want to see the two of you perform.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.860
Can you show me your performance?

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:58.560
I-I-I'll show you.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.510
It may not be the time for you to want to rub your eyes.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:50.240
Drinking juice is like a dream to me.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:55.900
But if I keep doing this, I won't be able to drink juice.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.730
That's why I'm lying.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.660
I can't cooperate with the woman I love.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:06.560
I can only get along with cats.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.520
I hate it.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.110
It's not because humans did something to me.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:15.260
I hate it because it's like a devil's instinct.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.960
And I hate demons, too.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.050
The devil took away my cat.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:27.570
Before I could get my cat back, I was caught by Makima.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.110
I might have been killed, but I won't give up.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:38.260
If I can get my cat back from the devil, I'll do anything on the human side.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.640
I don't know if it's like a cat or something.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.210
Cat?

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.160
I don't know.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.060
If I have to rub my chest, I can do anything.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.870
I don't understand humans.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:56.610
Yeah.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.340
But if it's a dog, he might still understand.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:09.900
If you were to take Nyako back from the devil, what would you do if he said he'd massage her chest?

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:17.460
A dog...

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.780
A cat...

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.570
I can't let that happen.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:22.820
Oh...

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.000
I won't forgive you for that!

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:25.740
Oh!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.610
I won't forgive you as a Devil Hunter!

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.030
I'm going to kill that devil!

00:05:30.508 --> 00:05:30.808
Damn.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.500
Demons, permission to go out.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:17.340
Please return by 17 o'clock.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.510
Can't you go out by yourself?

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.120
Yeah. I've been bored in here all this time.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:38.600
Do you know where the devil who took Nyako is?

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.010
The problem is that only you can fight.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.990
If you see my figure, you'll be taken down by Nyako.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.570
If that happens, it's a sin.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:58.180
I also beat the devil Pochitatsu.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.830
I can't pet you anymore, but it's fine. I'm living here.

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.070
Humans are foolish.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:09.830
Huh?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.440
That means Pochita is dead, right?

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.600
Dead lives are useless.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:20.000
What's inside your heart is a cruel consolation.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.910
Yeah, yeah, you're right.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:38.440
This guy will never get along with me.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:53.030
In the US, the Soviet Union is getting more and more popular.

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:56.000
There are rumors that they are using the devil for military purposes.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.660
If you wish...

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:01.610
The only enemy in Japan is the devil.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:06.420
Makima, do you have a dog that you gave to your squad?

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.160
I have one that can meet my expectations.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.630
And I have one that is interesting.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:14.850
Interesting?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.060
It's a puppy that I recently picked up.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.860
Your job is to raise a dog and use it.

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.280
Don't get me wrong.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.610
Benji is not interesting just because he is unpleasant.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.670
Why do you expect so much?

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.090
All demons are born with a name.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:13.020
The more you are afraid of that name, the more power the devil himself has.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:21.720
Coffee doesn't have a scary image at all, so if there was a coffee demon, it would be weak.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.230
But what if there was a car demon?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.840
Because I have the image of being pulled by a tire and dying.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.090
I think he's strong.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.820
Denji is a devil of the Chainsaw.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:40.020
I think he's funny.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:46.860
He's just funny and useless.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:52.530
The court only has goals and beliefs.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.850
But he said he just wanted to live.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.970
The court...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.960
I don't think it's a good idea.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.490
And I think I can get along with the devil.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.040
I'm still a kid.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:27.580
There's a cat and a devil over there in this house.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.540
Well, let's get going then.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:43.020
I don't want to be a chainsaw because I'll get a cold.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.140
Oh? Chainsaw?

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.880
Yeah, I can be a chainsaw.

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.290
You can't laugh at human jokes.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:52.530
Huh?

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:58.910
Oh? What's wrong?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.940
If you show yourself, you'll be treated like a cat, right?

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.780
You can't follow me this close.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.490
Oh, so that's how it was set up.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.090
Set up?

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.610
You're mistaken.

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:14.110
You're a weakling.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.220
That was a good feeling.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.920
I've been waiting for you, devil of blood.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:03.710
I thought you ran away.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.340
Don't complain!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.560
I finally got out.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:12.160
I brought humans as I wanted.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.900
Omori!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:20.120
It's been a long time since I had a meal.

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.310
Are you a young man?

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.310
You seem to be able to drink the blood of the force.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.030
Look at this scar on your arm, human.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.540
The scar you've been inflicted on me.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.140
It's a disgusting scar that made me unable to hide myself.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.140
Baal...

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.290
Don't you dare yell at me!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.790
The scar you've been inflicted on me...

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.370
I will heal it with the blood of a human!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:00.970
Nnngh!

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:01.880
This is bad!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:06.460
I've...

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.480
...succeeded in my first try!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:16.840
The inside of my blood feels rough.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.910
If only I hadn't had to talk to other humans...

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.340
Do you want to be friends with the devil?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:38.930
You really trusted my story.

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:44.970
As I thought, you're a good person.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.120
You're a fool.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.420
Smell of tobacco.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.540
Smell of cosmetics and medicine.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:00.840
Is that for real?

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:01.580
Oh my god!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:04.960
That's not a bad smell.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:09.120
I decided to give you a child.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.180
Devil of the bat!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:15.530
You brought humans as promised.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.100
I'll have you return the cat.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:18.680
Huh?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.280
Is that what you were talking about?

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:33.910
I still haven't gotten the punishment for bringing me bad food, have I?

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:38.420
Meow

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:44.980
That's a cat's name.

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:47.450
It smells delicious for a cat.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:53.920
It's a strong smell.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:58.770
I'll make you fat and then eat you.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.730
I can't wait to grow up and kill a child!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.020
It feels strange to hear a voice that is not a scream.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:49.500
There is no one.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:54.640
If you don't want to be killed by a cat, bring a human.

00:16:00.636 --> 00:16:00.896
Thank you.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:34.100
Ugh, this is bad.

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.100
This is the worst blood I've ever had.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:43.520
I'm so sick of this.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.400
If only I hadn't been stoned in my child's blood.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:55.330
After stoning, you'll be a daughter of a tree.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.420
The main character is a man who loves meat.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.150
Desserts are good for pregnant women.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:07.350
Give me back my chest.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.650
Drink my blood.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:11.970
It's disgusting.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.460
I'm not going to drink your blood.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:20.100
When Pochita was gone,

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.450
When I woke up in the morning, Pochita was gone.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:27.070
I can't find him even if I look all over the city.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:37.950
I thought I was eaten by the devil, but when I got home, I fell down and waited for me while crying.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:42.320
And I remember sleeping with him as it was.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:46.100
He was taken by the devil by Nyako.

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:32.950
You're such an idiot!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:39.350
What did you do?

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:43.430
What do you want to do with a devil?

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:49.670
I'm going to rip your stomach out and eat you alive!

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:45.800
You're not getting away from me!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.000
I won't let you get away!

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:57.310
You're not getting away from me!

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.580
You're not getting away from me!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.300
Why would you use that power to save a human?

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.380
Who said I could save a human?

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.930
It's a human's life!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.340
Kill him!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:47.890
First of all, I need to recover.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.660
I smell like cigarettes, but I'll forgive you for now.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.530
Why are you still alive?

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:06.920
I've been through a lot, but I can't help it.

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:12.680
I can't help it, but I can't help it.

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:34.550
T-KAYURU!

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:06.140
Oh
